'''Old Amber''' (Japanese: '''ひみつのコハク''' ''Secret Amber'') is an {{TCGP|Item}} card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It was first released as part of the {{TCGP|Genetic Apex}} expansion.

==Card text==
{{TCGTrainerText
|class=Item
|rule=SWSH Item
|effect=Play this card as if it were a 40-HP Basic {{e|Colorless}} Pokémon.<br>At any time during your turn, you may discard this card from play.<br>This card can't retreat.
}}

==Release information==
This card was first included in the {{TCGP|Genetic Apex}} expansion and was later reprinted with the same artwork in the {{TCGP|Mythical Island}} and {{TCGP|Deluxe Pack: ex}} expansions.

